## Takedown requests and corrections

If you hold rights in an image, appear in one, or find a wrong label or licence, tell us:

- **Public:** open a [takedown request](${github}/issues/new?template=takedown_request.yml),
  a [label error](${github}/issues/new?template=label_error.yml) or a
  [licence question](${github}/issues/new?template=licence_question.yml) on GitHub.
- **Private**, for example when the request involves personal data: write to ${contact} or use the
  [contact page](https://www.reef.support/contact).

Identify the rows by `image_sha256`, or by source and a description, and say what you ask for. We acknowledge a request
within a few working days. An accepted request removes the rows from the next revision and from later builds. The
[changelog](${github}/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) records the change without naming the
requester. The full procedure is in [SECURITY.md](${github}/blob/main/SECURITY.md).

